文章語言：雙語
        <div class="carousel-container">
  <div class="carousel-wrapper">
    <div class="carousel-track">
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/ooinn3-1.webp" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/ooinn3-2.webp" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="carousel-controls">
    <button class="carousel-btn prev">&#8592;</button>
    <div class="carousel-indicator">
      <span class="carousel-current">1</span>/<span class="carousel-total"
        >2</span
      >
    </div>
    <button class="carousel-btn next">&#8594;</button>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  (function () {
    const container = document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;
    const track = container.querySelector(".carousel-track");
    const images = track.querySelectorAll("img");
    const prevBtn = container.querySelector(".carousel-btn.prev");
    const nextBtn = container.querySelector(".carousel-btn.next");
    const indicator = container.querySelector(".carousel-indicator");
    const current = indicator.querySelector(".carousel-current");
    let idx = 0;
    function update() {
      track.style.transform = `translateX(-${idx * 100}%)`;
      current.textContent = idx + 1;
    }
    prevBtn.onclick = function () {
      idx = (idx - 1 + images.length) % images.length;
      update();
    };
    nextBtn.onclick = function () {
      idx = (idx + 1) % images.length;
      update();
    };

    let startX = null;
    track.addEventListener("touchstart", (e) => {
      startX = e.touches[0].clientX;
    });
    track.addEventListener("touchend", (e) => {
      if (startX === null) return;
      let dx = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - startX;
      if (Math.abs(dx) > 50) {
        if (dx < 0) nextBtn.onclick();
        else prevBtn.onclick();
      }
      startX = null;
    });
  })();
</script>



<div class="mandarin-content" lang="zh-hant" data-language="mandarin">
    <p>REGEX 語法：</p>
<ul>
<li><code>[你伊]?[這彼]个人</code></li>
<li><code>[你伊][這彼]个</code></li>
</ul>
<p>辭典例句編輯有個不成文的傳統，就是「
<a href="%28/sutian/5%29">負面語句不能指名道姓 </a>」，因此只要用以上的兩種句法找出各種「彼个人」、「伊彼个」等等的例句，就會查到一堆罵人的話喔！
也有人說，「彼个人」相當於辭典裡面的佛地魔，真的是兇惡至極的大反派</p>

</div> 


<div class="taiwanese-content" lang="und-hani" data-language="taiwanese">
    <p>REGEX 語法：</p>
<ul>
<li><code>[你伊]?[這彼]个人</code></li>
<li><code>[你伊][這彼]个</code></li>
</ul>
<p>辭典例句編輯有一个不成文的傳統，就是「
<a href="https://www.kiantiong.com/sutian/5">負面語句袂當講明確的名姓 </a>」，所以只要用頂面的兩个語法就通好揣著各種「彼个人」、「伊彼个」相關的例句，多數攏是罵人的話喔！
嘛有人說，「彼个人」就是辭典裡面的佛地魔，真正是歹甲至極的大反派</p>

</div>

文章語言：雙語
